<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>monster</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">lovepopstarzz, Proxie, Lil Witchy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">monster</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4CuwHXgaU2Mpx71CuPEwN1</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.092" end="00:06.592">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.118" end="00:07.639">How should I feel?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.639" end="00:09.140">Creatures lie here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.140" end="00:11.292">Looking through the window</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.292" end="00:12.792">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.677" end="00:14.177">How should I feel?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.106" end="00:15.627">Creatures lie here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.627" end="00:18.969">Looking through the window</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.969" end="00:20.469" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Mo-mo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.587" end="00:21.087">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.733" end="00:22.520">Party, sex, drugs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.520" end="00:24.034">Like a demon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.034" end="00:26.147">Catchin’ that vibe on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.147" end="00:27.647">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.416" end="00:29.002">Wearin’ top fits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.002" end="00:30.593">Raver nights here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.593" end="00:32.756">Lookin’ trough the windows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.756" end="00:34.256">Right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.072" end="00:38.102">All of the lights were turned off (turned off)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.102" end="00:41.283">I’m in the club playing my Nintendo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.283" end="00:44.135">You lookin so cute with your hair bows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.135" end="00:46.248">And your neon eye shadow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.248" end="00:47.748">Monsters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.329" end="00:49.030">Party, sex, drugs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.030" end="00:50.621">Give me head tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.621" end="00:52.719">Keep her from extension</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.719" end="00:54.219">Star girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.942" end="00:55.590">Be my vampire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.590" end="00:57.173">We’re on Xan so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.173" end="00:59.407">Is it love or drugs though?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.407" end="01:01.438">Now let’s go party around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.438" end="01:03.210">‘Till the sunlight is down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.210" end="01:04.731">I’m out of the club</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.731" end="01:06.972">But the melody is still in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.972" end="01:08.472">I will love you ‘till when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.330" end="01:09.932">Night reaches the end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.932" end="01:12.831">And we will be just two close friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.831" end="01:14.331" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Mo-mo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.516" end="01:15.016">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.549" end="01:16.260">Party, sex, drugs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.260" end="01:17.760">Like a demon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.591" end="01:20.002">Catchin’ that vibe on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.002" end="01:21.502">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.172" end="01:22.765">Wearin’ top fits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.765" end="01:24.433">Raver nights here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.433" end="01:26.558">Lookin’ trough the windows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.558" end="01:28.058">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.808" end="01:29.573">Party, sex, drugs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.573" end="01:31.073">Like a demon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.055" end="01:33.226">Catchin’ that vibe on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.226" end="01:34.726">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.511" end="01:36.032">Wearin’ top fits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.032" end="01:37.634">Raver nights here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.634" end="01:39.902">Lookin’ trough the windows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.902" end="01:41.629">Monster in my bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.629" end="01:43.629">Needs hearts to eat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.629" end="01:45.171">Leaves me with paralyzed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.171" end="01:47.012">I’m half asleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.012" end="01:48.620">My body stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.620" end="01:50.439">I cannot move</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.439" end="01:51.939">She touches me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.759" end="01:53.407">Tears never help</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.407" end="01:54.907">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.243" end="01:55.954">You’re my vampire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.954" end="01:57.475">You’re the one that’s</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.475" end="01:59.561">Always in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.561" end="02:01.061">You break me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.849" end="02:04.141">Eat my heart now you’re a monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.141" end="02:07.318">Always in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.318" end="02:08.818" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Mo-mo-mo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.343" end="02:09.843">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.289" end="02:10.890">Party, sex, drugs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.890" end="02:12.390">Like a demon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.357" end="02:14.497">Catchin’ that vibe on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.497" end="02:15.997">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.758" end="02:17.369">Wearin’ top fits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.369" end="02:18.928">Raver nights here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.928" end="02:21.158">Lookin’ trough the windows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.158" end="02:22.658">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.578" end="02:24.078">Party, sex, drugs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.056" end="02:25.612">Like a demon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.612" end="02:27.780">Catchin’ that vibe on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.780" end="02:29.280">Monster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.122" end="02:30.622">Wearin’ top fits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.569" end="02:32.288">Raver nights here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.288" end="02:36.288">Lookin’ trough the windows</p></div></body></tt>